               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="1">
               <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spinBoxBrakeDeadNs">
                <property name="toolTip">
                 <string>插入死区时长(ns)。20 ns = 1 个 aclk 周期, 范围 100..10000 ns: 小于 100 ns 等于没插死区(上下管直通风险), 会被夹到 100 ns 或被下位机拒绝; 占空比为 0 时死区强制为 0。</string>
                </property>
                <property name="minimum">
                 <number>0</number>
                </property>
                <property name="maximum">
                 <number>10000</number>
                </property>
                <property name="singleStep">
                 <number>20</number>
                </property>
                <property name="value">
                 <number>500</number>
                </property>
                <property name="suffix">
                 <string> ns</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="2">
               <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonApplyBrakeDead">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>下发死区</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="3" colspan="2">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="labelBrakeTip">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>占空比帧 0xDA+16bit+0xDB / 死区帧 0xDC+16bit+0xDD; 上电默认制动关闭</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="2" column="0">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="labelBrakeZero">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>电流零点</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="2" column="1" colspan="2">
               <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonBrakeZero">
                <property name="toolTip">
                 <string>发 0xE3: 在**制动关闭、线圈无电流**时采 2 s 电压, 把这 5 个电压设成各自的归零电压 —— 之后静止时 5 路电流读数应该是 0.000 A。要求正在采样(0xE0)且制动关闭(0xA5); 否则板子会拒绝。</string>
                </property>
                <property name="text">
                 <string>电流零点校准 (0xE3)</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="2" column="3" colspan="2">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="labelBrakeZeroTip">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>完成后板子回一行 "ads zero (mV): ...", 即各路归零电压</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
             </layout>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item>
            <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBoxCurrentCmd">
             <property name="title">
              <string>电流指令发送(5 路 PID 共用同一目标, 帧 0xBA+16bit mA+0xAB)</string>
             </property>
             <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayoutCurrentCmd">
              <item row="0" column="0">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="labelCurrentCmd">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>目标电流</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="0" column="1" colspan="3">
               <widget class="QSlider" name="sliderCurrentCmd">
                <property name="toolTip">
                 <string>拖动即下发电流指令帧 [0xBA][低字节][高字节][0xAB], 数据 = 目标电流(mA), 范围 0..15000。5 个桥共用这条指令; 0 mA = 停止(下位机把占空比爬到 0 后关桥输出)。</string>
                </property>
                <property name="minimum">
                 <number>0</number>
                </property>
                <property name="maximum">
                 <number>15000</number>
                </property>
                <property name="singleStep">
                 <number>10</number>
                </property>
                <property name="pageStep">
                 <number>500</number>
                </property>
                <property name="value">
                 <number>0</number>
                </property>
                <property name="orientation">
                 <enum>Qt::Orientation::Horizontal</enum>
                </property>
                <property name="tickPosition">
                 <enum>QSlider::TickPosition::TicksBelow</enum>
                </property>
                <property name="tickInterval">
                 <number>1500</number>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="0" column="4">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="labelCurrentCmdValue">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>0.00 A</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="0">
               <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonCurrentZero">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>电流归零 (0 A)</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="1" colspan="4">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="labelCurrentCmdTip">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>下位机 PID: 误差 = 目标 − 实测; 5 路独立状态, 占空比上限 37/40/28/45/75 %; 积分浮点 + 抗饱和 + 每拍爬坡限速</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
             </layout>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item>
            <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBoxLed">
             <property name="title">
              <string>4 路呼吸灯(breath_led IP: LED0=K16 · LED1=J16 · LED2=K14 · LED3=J14)</string>
             </property>
             <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayoutLed">
              <item row="0" column="0">
               <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxLed0">
                <property name="toolTip">
                 <string>LED0 = K16。它同时被板子当作&quot;网口在线&quot;指示灯: 上位机连上/断开时板子会自动点亮/熄灭它一次, 两次变化之间以这里的勾选为准。</string>
                </property>
                <property name="text">
                 <string>LED0 (K16 · 网口在线)</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="0" column="1">
               <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxLed1">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>LED1 (J16)</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="0" column="2">
               <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxLed2">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>LED2 (K14)</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="0" column="3">
               <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxLed3">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>LED3 (J14)</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="0">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="labelLedFreq">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>共享呼吸频率 (Hz)</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="1">
               <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spinBoxLedFreq">
                <property name="toolTip">
                 <string>四路共用一个频率(IP 里只有一个 PERIOD 寄存器)。这个数不是&quot;每秒闪几下&quot;: 明暗周期 = 100000 / 本值 毫秒, 所以 100 ≈ 1 s, 1000 ≈ 100 ms(最快)。范围 10..1000, 越界会被板子拒绝。</string>
                </property>
                <property name="minimum">
                 <number>10</number>
                </property>
                <property name="maximum">
                 <number>1000</number>
                </property>
                <property name="singleStep">
                 <number>10</number>
                </property>
                <property name="value">
                 <number>100</number>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="2">
               <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonLedApply">
                <property name="toolTip">
                 <string>发 0xFE &lt;频率/10&gt; + 0xFF &lt;勾选掩码&gt;。掩码 bit0..3 依次对应 LED0..3。</string>
                </property>
                <property name="text">
                 <string>下发勾选 (0xFF)</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="3">
               <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonLedStat">
                <property name="toolTip">
                 <string>发 0xF4 读板子上的真实掩码和频率, 并按回复回填上面的勾选框和频率(板子才是准的)。</string>
                </property>
                <property name="text">
                 <string>读板子状态 (0xF4)</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="2" column="0">
               <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonLedAllOn">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>四路全亮</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="2" column="1">
               <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonLedAllOff">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>四路全灭</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="3" column="0" colspan="4">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="labelLedHint">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>提示: 四路共用一个呼吸频率(IP 里只有一组斜坡计数器、一个 PERIOD 寄存器), 所以每颗灯只有&quot;灭&quot;和&quot;按共享频率呼吸&quot;两种状态 —— 做不到这颗快、那颗慢, 也没有&quot;常亮不呼吸&quot;。老命令 LED_STA_1/2/3 只改频率并保证至少有一颗亮, 不会关掉你在这里点亮的其它灯; LED_STA_0 是四路全灭。</string>
                </property>
                <property name="wordWrap">
                 <bool>true</bool>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
             </layout>
            </widget>
           </item>
           
           <item>
            <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBoxComm">
             <property name="title">
              <string>自检与调试</string>
             </property>
             <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayoutComm">
              <item row="0" column="0">
               <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonPing">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>PING</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="0" column="1">
               <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonStatus">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>STATUS</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="2" column="0" colspan="3">
               <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxDemo">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>本地模拟数据(不接板子, 用于演示曲线)</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="2" column="3">
               <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spinBoxDemoPeriod">
                <property name="suffix">
                 <string> ms</string>
                </property>
                <property name="minimum">
                 <number>10</number>
                </property>
                <property name="maximum">
                 <number>1000</number>
                </property>
                <property name="singleStep">
                 <number>10</number>
                </property>
                <property name="value">
                 <number>50</number>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="3" column="0" colspan="4">
               <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxShowTelemetry">
                <property name="toolTip">
                 <string>不勾选时: 遥测数据只进曲线, 不往接收区刷 —— 这样命令和回复才看得见</string>
                </property>
                <property name="text">
                 <string>接收区显示遥测数据行(会刷屏, 默认只进曲线)</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
             </layout>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item>
            <widget class="QGroupBox" name="groupBoxDisplayCfg">
             <property name="title">
              <string>显示设置</string>
             </property>
             <layout class="QGridLayout" name="gridLayoutDisplayCfg">
              <item row="0" column="0">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="labelXTitle">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>横轴标题</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="0" column="1">
               <widget class="QLineEdit" name="lineEditXTitle">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>时间</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="0">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="labelYMin">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>纵轴下限</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="1">
               <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="doubleSpinBoxYMin">
                <property name="minimum">
                 <double>-1000000.000000000000000</double>
                </property>
                <property name="maximum">
                 <double>1000000.000000000000000</double>
                </property>
                <property name="value">
                 <double>-5.000000000000000</double>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="2">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="labelYMax">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>纵轴上限</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="1" column="3">
               <widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="doubleSpinBoxYMax">
                <property name="minimum">
                 <double>-1000000.000000000000000</double>
                </property>
                <property name="maximum">
                 <double>1000000.000000000000000</double>
                </property>
                <property name="value">
                 <double>60.000000000000000</double>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="2" column="0">
               <widget class="QLabel" name="labelXSpan">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>横轴窗口</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="2" column="1">
               <widget class="QSpinBox" name="spinBoxXSpan">
                <property name="suffix">
                 <string> 点</string>
                </property>
                <property name="minimum">
                 <number>10</number>
                </property>
                <property name="maximum">
                 <number>100000</number>
                </property>
                <property name="singleStep">
                 <number>10</number>
                </property>
                <property name="value">
                 <number>100</number>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="2" column="3">
               <widget class="QPushButton" name="pushButtonApplyDisplay">
                <property name="text">
                 <string>应用显示设置</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item row="3" column="0" colspan="4">
               <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBoxAutoScaleY">
                <property name="toolTip">
                 <string>线圈 1~5 画的是**线圈电流(A)**(下位机按 I = (1.5V - 2.5)*10 换算过); "速度"那条(板子 DATA 行第 7 个数)是 CH6 引脚的真实电压(V), "电压"那条(第 8 个数)是母线电压(V, 已按 11:1 还原)。几组量纲差很多, 手动纵轴很容易把某一组压成一条直线, 默认打开自动缩放, 按当前勾选的曲线自动定范围。</string>
                </property>
                <property name="text">
                 <string>纵轴自动缩放(按当前显示的曲线)</string>
                </property>
                <property name="checked">
                 <bool>true</bool>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
             </layout>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item>
            <spacer name="verticalSpacerPreset">
             <property name="orientation">
              <enum>Qt::Orientation::Vertical</enum>
             </property>
             <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
              <size>
               <width>20</width>
               <height>20</height>
              </size>
             </property>
            </spacer>
           </item>
          </layout>
         </widget>
        </widget>
       </item>
      </layout>
     </widget>
    </widget>
   </item>
  </layout>
 </widget>
